  "abstract_summary": "Large language models (LLMs) have changed enterprise knowledge work. Their value, however, is capped by three failures: they hallucinate, their parametric memory is frozen and grows stale, and they cannot read the proprietary data that holds most business answers. Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) targets all thr...",
